Fire a glowing orb of light at each enemy within your Radiance.  Each orb will slowly follow its target until it connects, dealing [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage to anything else it contacts along the way.  When the target is reached the orb will explode dealing [152, 205, 246, 281, 311 (TL1-5; SP 100)] light damage in radius 1 and healing you for 50% of the damage dealt.

All targets struck by your Judgement will be blighted by light, reducing saves by [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100)], reducing critical power by [22%, 30%, 36%, 41%, 46% (TL1-5; SP 100)], and causing light damage received to splash in radius 2 for [21%, 32%, 39%, 45%, 49% (TL1-5)] damage against all hostile targets for 4 turns.
